+    # commit evidence present), the wait returns `:ok` and emits a non-error
+    # WARN `claude_completion_fallback` audit event instead of `:timeout`.
+    # Strict behavior is UNCHANGED when no predicate is supplied or the
+    # predicate fails. Limit-wall checks stay ahead so a usage/credit wall can
+    # never be classified as a clean completion.
